    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00218",
        "explanation": "The last doctor plan was executable for oxygen, antibiotics, and follow-up alternatives.",
        "quote": "不要自己额外去买抗生素吃"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00232",
        "explanation": "The caregiver showed substantial receipt of the plan but still asked for confirmation at the end.",
        "quote": "我这样理解对吧？"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The plan gave practical medication, monitoring, and 2-3 day follow-up steps, and the family could restate them. Closure is still questionable/premature because the final caregiver message sought confirmation and the escalation checklist remained incomplete for hemoptysis and some cardiac-associated chest-pain red flags.",
